<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ImmuLogic downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ImmuLogic downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it downgraded ImmuLogic Pharmaceutical Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-3/8 to 8-1/8 in early afternoon Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
